WEBVTT

01:40.690 --> 01:44.200
[A Moment But Forever]

01:45.070 --> 01:47.180
[Episode 24]

01:48.170 --> 01:51.680
[Ningrui Pavilion]

02:03.110 --> 02:06.470
♫I gaze into your deep eyes♫

02:07.750 --> 02:11.200
♫For whom do you take apart the word "love"?♫

02:13.890 --> 02:17.190
♫Turning around, it's like a dream♫

02:17.880 --> 02:22.350
♫I have betrayed deep love♫

02:24.730 --> 02:27.820
♫Heaving a long, helpless sigh♫

02:29.530 --> 02:32.930
♫Time flies too rapidly♫

02:35.690 --> 02:38.740
♫Life is like a flying bird♫

02:40.210 --> 02:45.110
♫Joining, scattering, no way back♫

02:45.750 --> 02:47.190
Stop being unreasonable.

02:45.810 --> 02:48.950
♫Unable to get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

02:47.400 --> 02:49.250
I won't be nice to you if you keep messing with me.

02:49.280 --> 02:50.520
You startled my horse and it broke away.

02:50.840 --> 02:52.150
But you didn't even apologize.

02:51.260 --> 02:54.340
♫When I brush past love fate is set♫

02:52.150 --> 02:53.800
Tell me, don't you deserve a beating?

02:53.840 --> 02:55.590
Your horse ran away on its own.

02:55.590 --> 02:56.520
What does it have to do with me?

02:55.740 --> 02:57.890
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

02:56.520 --> 02:58.360
I simply coughed and it was scared away.

02:58.470 --> 02:59.630
Do you think it's safe to ride a horse of that kind?

02:59.480 --> 03:01.370
♫I couldn't describe♫

03:00.840 --> 03:02.520
Anyway, I demand compensation.

03:01.890 --> 03:06.180
♫This lovesick path with you♫

03:03.280 --> 03:04.310
This is ridiculous.

03:07.100 --> 03:08.920
♫After the farewell, where are you now?♫

03:08.960 --> 03:11.920
♫Who do you spend your days with?♫

03:12.480 --> 03:17.020
♫Do you know I'm willing to wait for you until the end?♫

03:18.380 --> 03:20.910
♫Sighing that the world is too lonely♫

03:20.940 --> 03:23.050
♫They laugh at me for being foolish♫

03:22.120 --> 03:23.400
You're no match for me.

03:23.500 --> 03:24.750
You don't even dare to draw your sword out.

03:23.530 --> 03:28.510
♫Longing is in my song; the people are not as before♫

03:24.870 --> 03:25.960
Yet you have the audacity to bluff.

03:25.960 --> 03:27.000
Fine, young lady,

03:27.000 --> 03:28.470
if you must learn this lesson the hard way.

03:41.350 --> 03:44.110
♫The wind is bound to miss♫

03:45.910 --> 03:49.710
♫The thick clouds♫

03:51.430 --> 03:52.240
Are you okay?

03:52.310 --> 03:55.760
♫Fate leaves no room for regrets♫

03:53.680 --> 03:54.560
You're a skillful martial fighter,

03:54.840 --> 03:56.310
but not an experienced one.

03:56.690 --> 04:01.680
♫Fate only urges you to move forward♫

03:57.079 --> 03:59.000
Sir, since I left Yandu,

03:59.079 --> 04:00.680
I've met many skillful fighters,

04:00.910 --> 04:02.190
but you're the first one

04:02.190 --> 04:03.470
that I find respectable.

04:02.230 --> 04:05.870
♫Can't get what I yearn for, I sink in sadness♫

04:06.150 --> 04:06.960
How about this?

04:07.080 --> 04:08.430
If you have a rematch with me,

04:07.690 --> 04:11.290
♫When I brush past love, fate is set♫

04:08.520 --> 04:10.150
that little dispute of ours will be ended.

04:10.150 --> 04:10.910
What do you say?

04:12.840 --> 04:14.520
Let's have one more match with our bare hands.

04:12.900 --> 04:15.480
♫I've used up my brush and ink♫

04:15.820 --> 04:17.980
♫I couldn't describe♫

04:18.510 --> 04:22.710
♫This lovesick path with you♫

04:23.500 --> 04:25.240
♫After the farewell, where are you now?♫

04:25.260 --> 04:28.700
♫Who do you spend your days with?♫

04:28.360 --> 04:29.160
What are you looking at?

04:28.920 --> 04:33.880
♫Do you know I'm willing to wait for you until the end?♫

04:29.480 --> 04:30.270
Nothing.

04:31.560 --> 04:32.630
Some memories just flooded back.

04:34.720 --> 04:36.980
♫Sighing that the world is too lonely♫

04:35.510 --> 04:36.680
Eat the soup now.

04:37.220 --> 04:39.690
♫They laugh at me for being foolish♫

04:38.800 --> 04:39.600
Zhi Dai...

04:40.370 --> 04:44.440
♫Longing is in my song; the people are not as before♫

04:42.950 --> 04:43.750
I'm sorry.

04:45.690 --> 04:54.890
♫People are not as they were in this lifetime♫

05:06.560 --> 05:07.390
You already woke up?

05:08.450 --> 05:09.130
Did I...

05:09.160 --> 05:10.450
Did I disturb you?

05:12.600 --> 05:13.150
No.

05:16.190 --> 05:17.600
Tanyin just brought some

05:17.600 --> 05:18.560
food and supplies to you.

05:18.630 --> 05:19.800
She thought you were asleep,

05:19.800 --> 05:20.870
so she left.

05:23.920 --> 05:25.310
I'll put them there then?

05:33.510 --> 05:34.750
Do you want to meet her?

05:34.750 --> 05:35.920
She probably hasn't gone far.

05:35.920 --> 05:37.310
I can go get her back.

05:44.240 --> 05:45.040
Lift up your head.

05:53.120 --> 05:54.480
I've never noticed

05:54.960 --> 05:56.360
how long your hair is.

06:00.950 --> 06:02.480
Why don't I tie it up for you?

06:03.310 --> 06:04.120
No need.

06:04.630 --> 06:05.430
Come on.

06:06.920 --> 06:07.720
No need.

06:08.320 --> 06:09.900
Come on!

06:14.750 --> 06:16.480
You hair is so stiff.

06:17.070 --> 06:17.870
Flyaway, too.

06:21.480 --> 06:22.600
Why don't I put your hair into braids?

06:22.600 --> 06:23.310
No.

06:23.680 --> 06:24.680
Come on,

06:24.680 --> 06:25.830
you always reject me.

06:25.830 --> 06:26.560
Don't you see

06:26.560 --> 06:28.040
how good my skills are?

06:28.270 --> 06:29.310
Be honest with me.

06:29.310 --> 06:30.630
Does my hairstyle look bad to you?

06:34.159 --> 06:35.070
No braids.

06:36.270 --> 06:38.070
Fine, I won't put your hair into braids.

06:38.070 --> 06:38.950
No braids.

06:42.920 --> 06:44.800
You're close with Tanyin, aren't you?

06:44.870 --> 06:46.360
I saw clothes and boots

06:46.360 --> 06:47.630
in the packages she sent you.

06:47.870 --> 06:49.240
It means she even knows

06:49.240 --> 06:50.070
your measurements.

06:51.510 --> 06:52.480
She's a craftsman.

06:52.950 --> 06:53.870
She has a keen eye.

06:54.720 --> 06:55.510
She can also figure out

06:55.510 --> 06:57.070
your measurements with just a glimpse at you.

06:57.270 --> 06:58.070
Really?

06:59.240 --> 07:00.360
That's impressive.

07:10.830 --> 07:11.630
All done!

07:12.070 --> 07:13.040
What do you think?

07:13.830 --> 07:15.160
It seems pretty good to me.

07:15.160 --> 07:16.480
It's much neater than before.

07:16.630 --> 07:18.070
When you put some new clothes on,

07:18.270 --> 07:20.040
you'll definitely look stunning.

07:27.830 --> 07:29.430
Do you have a crush on Tanyin?

07:33.050 --> 07:34.170
I'm a War Demon.

07:43.310 --> 07:44.190
A War Demon

07:44.190 --> 07:45.600
who is deprived of his magic source.

07:47.870 --> 07:49.040
I lost my mother,

07:50.080 --> 07:51.230
and caused my brother's death,

07:52.920 --> 07:54.190
I'm homeless,

07:54.480 --> 07:55.600
with my life at stake.

08:01.120 --> 08:02.270
Who am I

08:03.650 --> 08:05.130
to love anyone?

08:09.750 --> 08:11.310
Miss Ji, Miss Ji!

08:12.120 --> 08:12.950
Mr. Xu,

08:12.950 --> 08:14.510
I told you I had something else to do.

08:15.020 --> 08:16.160
Nothing is more important

08:16.160 --> 08:17.310
than what I have for you here.

08:17.390 --> 08:18.160
Listen,

08:18.160 --> 08:19.430
just wait here for a moment.

08:19.430 --> 08:20.070
Just a moment.

08:20.070 --> 08:21.870
I'll bring someone to meet you.

08:22.600 --> 08:23.560
Now is really late.

08:23.560 --> 08:24.870
I must go.

08:25.630 --> 08:26.430
Miss Ji,

08:26.430 --> 08:28.040
why are you so stubborn?

08:28.040 --> 08:28.830
I'm telling you,

08:28.830 --> 08:30.190
a big shot

08:30.390 --> 08:31.950
likes the Lucky Eggs you created.

08:31.950 --> 08:33.960
You are so blessed.

08:38.630 --> 08:40.360
This drawing shows how to make Lucky Eggs.

08:40.549 --> 08:41.390
Please give it

08:41.390 --> 08:42.440
to that big shot.

08:42.510 --> 08:43.440
Tell him

08:43.440 --> 08:44.630
that I thank him for appreciating my creation.

08:44.790 --> 08:46.000
I have to be somewhere else now,

08:46.120 --> 08:47.360
so I can't meet with him.

08:47.360 --> 08:48.480
I'll be going now.

08:49.850 --> 08:51.300
Miss J! Miss Ji!

08:51.550 --> 08:52.130
I...

08:53.320 --> 08:54.390
This...

08:59.360 --> 09:00.150
Mr. Yuan,

09:00.200 --> 09:01.720
waiting for your wife again, aren't you?

09:05.320 --> 09:06.720
At this hour of the day,

09:06.720 --> 09:07.670
I guess she's on her way back.

09:07.670 --> 09:08.910
You'll have noodles as usual, right?

09:09.580 --> 09:10.110
Yes.

09:10.150 --> 09:11.550
Alright, two bowls of noodles.

09:13.000 --> 09:14.080
Welcome.

09:14.080 --> 09:14.840
Come on in.

09:15.670 --> 09:16.720
What would you like to order?

09:18.480 --> 09:20.510
Miss, a gentleman

09:20.510 --> 09:22.150
asked me to give this to you.

09:22.150 --> 09:24.030
He said this lantern

09:24.030 --> 09:25.080
will lead you to him.

09:25.080 --> 09:26.750
He would like a word with you.

09:27.440 --> 09:28.720
Who is that gentleman?

09:29.000 --> 09:29.910
Did he tell you

09:29.910 --> 09:30.960
his name?

09:39.480 --> 09:40.670
Could it be Yuanzhong?

10:14.550 --> 10:15.360
Mr. Yuan,

10:15.720 --> 10:16.630
it's my fault

10:16.840 --> 10:18.510
for cooking the noodles too early.

10:18.720 --> 10:19.670
How about this?

10:19.750 --> 10:20.790
I'll take these away

10:20.790 --> 10:21.910
now,

10:22.120 --> 10:23.360
and bring you freshly cooked noodles

10:23.360 --> 10:24.550
when your wife arrives.

10:26.600 --> 10:27.320
Thank you.

10:27.320 --> 10:28.030
No worries.

10:35.790 --> 10:36.720
You stay put.

11:11.550 --> 11:12.510
Miss, you arrived

11:12.510 --> 11:13.550
sooner than I expected.

11:14.200 --> 11:15.000
It's you.

11:16.360 --> 11:17.320
What do you want from me?

11:18.150 --> 11:19.150
Why not take a seat

11:21.080 --> 11:22.080
for a nice chat with me?

11:25.510 --> 11:27.910
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

11:31.270 --> 11:32.080
One more!

11:32.150 --> 11:34.390
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

11:35.870 --> 11:36.670
Bravo!

11:38.940 --> 11:39.700
Ma'am,

11:39.720 --> 11:41.290
you'll look great with this on.

11:42.080 --> 11:43.240
It does look good.

11:45.150 --> 11:46.030
I'll take this.

11:46.200 --> 11:47.870
I'd like to pick some more items as gifts.

11:48.320 --> 11:49.390
You have great taste.

11:53.480 --> 11:54.480
What are you doing here?

11:55.560 --> 11:57.170
Beanie, are you okay?

12:00.550 --> 12:02.600
This little boy looks strong and spirited.

12:02.600 --> 12:03.510
What a good boy.

12:04.320 --> 12:05.200
So adorable.

12:05.200 --> 12:07.840
I bet he's blessed with good fortune.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.480
Do you like this?

12:14.720 --> 12:16.070
I have so many more of this at home.

12:16.360 --> 12:18.120
Sir, why don't you bring the boy to my place

12:18.120 --> 12:19.360
for a visit and a play date?

12:19.360 --> 12:20.120
No need.

12:24.240 --> 12:25.360
Have you seen Ji Tanyin?

12:49.020 --> 12:52.850
[Subtle Fragrance and Lonely Shadows]

12:53.720 --> 12:54.750
Why did you stop?

12:56.140 --> 12:58.190
That was the end.

12:59.120 --> 13:00.270
What do you think of it?

13:01.510 --> 13:02.630
I don't know much about music.

13:03.200 --> 13:05.030
Just tell me if it sounded good or not.

13:06.240 --> 13:07.080
It was nice.

13:07.390 --> 13:08.480
It sounded melancholy,

13:09.600 --> 13:10.750
but joyful at the same time.

13:11.440 --> 13:13.480
It was like someone spent several days and nights

13:13.550 --> 13:14.240
creating something

13:14.240 --> 13:15.720
to his satisfaction.

13:16.550 --> 13:17.600
He felt exhausted

13:18.270 --> 13:19.320
but meanwhile pleased.

13:21.480 --> 13:22.870
You're amazing.

13:23.510 --> 13:24.270
I've played this piece

13:24.270 --> 13:25.360
for many people,

13:25.790 --> 13:27.630
and received a lot of praise

13:27.630 --> 13:28.480
and compliments.

13:29.240 --> 13:30.030
However,

13:30.360 --> 13:31.910
only your interpretation

13:32.000 --> 13:33.720
speaks my mind.

13:34.600 --> 13:35.360
Why on earth did you

13:35.360 --> 13:36.390
lead me here?

13:37.790 --> 13:39.150
Just to hear you play this piece?

13:39.150 --> 13:40.670
Do you really not remember me?

13:40.670 --> 13:42.000
Should I remember you?

13:45.270 --> 13:46.790
This is truly heartbreaking.

13:48.270 --> 13:50.720
I shouldn't have spent so many days and nights thinking about you.

13:52.720 --> 13:53.510
Miss,

13:54.750 --> 13:55.790
what do you think of me?

13:56.550 --> 13:57.510
What do you mean?

13:57.910 --> 13:58.870
How is my appearance?

13:59.270 --> 14:00.150
How is my body shape?

14:01.270 --> 14:02.750
Do you like

14:03.000 --> 14:04.480
my demeanor and manner?

14:05.480 --> 14:06.270
Mr. Fu.

14:06.550 --> 14:07.910
If you keep talking nonsense like this,

14:07.910 --> 14:08.840
I'll leave right away.

14:11.240 --> 14:12.320
Highly improbable.

14:13.240 --> 14:14.200
By all accounts,

14:14.550 --> 14:16.070
I should be

14:16.910 --> 14:18.390
the most ideal man you could imagine.

14:19.670 --> 14:21.240
The High Priest of Youhu Clan

14:21.360 --> 14:22.670
is not even half as good as me.

14:22.670 --> 14:24.000
Why would you like him?

14:25.750 --> 14:27.270
I don't know what you're talking about.

14:28.630 --> 14:30.550
Or is the Divine Left Hand your real purpose?

14:32.790 --> 14:33.960
Do you plan to take his hand away?

14:35.240 --> 14:36.550
I can tell from his looks

14:36.600 --> 14:38.390
that if he loses the Divine Left Hand,

14:38.550 --> 14:39.910
he won't live long.

14:42.270 --> 14:43.480
Who are you exactly?

14:45.960 --> 14:46.750
Venture a guess.

14:49.120 --> 14:50.000
Come on, take a guess.

14:50.670 --> 14:51.750
Won't it be boring

14:52.150 --> 14:53.360
if I just give you the answer?

15:00.630 --> 15:02.480
High Priest, you have such a hot temper.

15:09.630 --> 15:10.440
Miss Ji,

15:10.750 --> 15:12.000
we had such a lovely chat.

15:12.080 --> 15:13.550
Too bad that it was interrupted by an uninvited guest.

15:13.720 --> 15:16.200
I'll talk to you next time.

15:33.960 --> 15:35.240
Slow down, please!

15:35.600 --> 15:36.390
Yuanzhong!

15:37.870 --> 15:39.000
Have you eaten dinner yet?

15:39.910 --> 15:40.750
I haven't.

15:40.750 --> 15:41.750
Shall we go buy some

15:41.750 --> 15:42.390
sweet cakes?

15:42.390 --> 15:43.440
What about the noodles?

15:45.480 --> 15:46.410
What noodles?

15:48.630 --> 15:49.870
You want sweet cakes.

15:50.080 --> 15:51.350
Fine. I'm okay with it.

15:51.440 --> 15:52.120
But why

15:52.120 --> 15:53.320
couldn't you tell me earlier?

15:53.320 --> 15:54.670
I bought two bowls of noodles and I waited for you.

15:54.670 --> 15:55.840
What should we do with the noodles now?

15:56.840 --> 15:57.630
I...

15:57.750 --> 15:59.510
At the exact time I knew you would be back,

15:59.550 --> 16:01.360
I went to the restaurant, ordered two bowls of noodles,

16:01.360 --> 16:02.910
and waited from day to night for you.

16:02.950 --> 16:03.840
If I had known

16:03.840 --> 16:04.840
that you wanted sweet cakes,

16:04.840 --> 16:05.960
I wouldn't have gone to the trouble

16:05.960 --> 16:07.120
of ordering two bowls of noodles, right?

16:07.390 --> 16:08.240
Now the noodles are all mushy.

16:08.240 --> 16:09.240
How can we eat it?

16:09.440 --> 16:11.270
It's okay. I can have noodles.

16:11.720 --> 16:12.510
Ji Tanyin.

16:13.080 --> 16:14.080
How come I never noticed

16:14.080 --> 16:15.120
what a fickle woman you are?

16:15.320 --> 16:15.960
Didn't you

16:15.960 --> 16:17.080
just ask for sweet cakes?

16:17.080 --> 16:18.600
Why do you want to have noodles now?

16:18.910 --> 16:19.720
It's too late.

16:19.750 --> 16:20.390
Those two bowls of noodles

16:20.390 --> 16:21.390
have already been thrown away.

16:21.390 --> 16:22.200
They're gone.

16:22.440 --> 16:23.840
Go buy sweet cakes for yourself.

16:23.840 --> 16:24.870
Just buy whatever you want,

16:24.870 --> 16:26.270
and eat whatever you want!

16:26.330 --> 16:27.450
We like different food.

16:27.580 --> 16:28.860
Neither of us should make a compromise.

16:29.840 --> 16:31.030
But I do have a request.

16:31.320 --> 16:32.870
if you didn't want to have noodles,

16:32.870 --> 16:34.390
you should've let me know earlier,

16:34.440 --> 16:35.670
so that I wouldn't have bothered to

16:35.670 --> 16:37.080
order two bowls of noodles and wasted them!

16:37.440 --> 16:38.240
I...

16:55.790 --> 16:56.600
Yuanzhong,

16:57.390 --> 16:58.360
are you asleep?

17:03.510 --> 17:04.300
May I come in?

17:09.700 --> 17:10.940
If you don't say anything,

17:11.349 --> 17:12.880
I'll take it as a yes.

17:32.110 --> 17:32.920
Yuanzhong,

17:34.160 --> 17:35.590
I didn't have dinner.

17:36.220 --> 17:37.260
I felt too hungry to fall asleep.

17:37.960 --> 17:38.750
So,

17:39.160 --> 17:40.750
I bought two bowls of noodles.

17:41.790 --> 17:42.920
Can you get up and eat them

17:42.920 --> 17:43.680
with me?

17:50.720 --> 17:51.790
Are you asleep?

18:27.590 --> 18:29.350
Today, Mr. Xu in Qiju Pavilion

18:30.550 --> 18:31.790
said an important person

18:31.790 --> 18:33.110
was impressed by my craft skills,

18:34.000 --> 18:35.200
so he wanted to meet me.

18:36.680 --> 18:38.030
But all I was thinking at that time

18:38.030 --> 18:39.750
was that I must come back to have dinner with you.

18:40.590 --> 18:41.830
So I declined to meet with that person.

18:42.830 --> 18:44.400
Later, on my way back,

18:44.910 --> 18:46.260
I met a child.

18:47.270 --> 18:48.790
He gave me a lantern,

18:49.920 --> 18:51.640
saying that it would

18:52.070 --> 18:53.270
lead me

18:53.270 --> 18:54.920
to a gentleman who was longing to see me.

18:58.000 --> 18:59.200
I thought that was you,

18:59.640 --> 19:00.880
so I went for the meeting.

19:18.400 --> 19:19.310
I'm sorry.

19:20.960 --> 19:22.110
I didn't know you would

19:22.110 --> 19:23.310
wait for me for so long.

19:41.270 --> 19:42.270
I've finished eating.

19:42.640 --> 19:43.750
I should probably go.

19:44.790 --> 19:46.000
If you feel hungry,

19:46.160 --> 19:47.400
please get up and have a bite.

19:48.310 --> 19:50.070
If you let the noodles sit here for too long,

19:50.360 --> 19:51.600
they will stick together and taste bad.

20:33.240 --> 20:35.000
Grand Elder, we're out of Blood Pills.

20:35.000 --> 20:36.400
Maybe you'll feel better with this ginseng tea.

20:38.720 --> 20:40.000
Without Blood Pills,

20:41.400 --> 20:43.270
whatever I drink won't make a difference.

20:44.270 --> 20:45.070
How about...

20:45.110 --> 20:45.750
How about

20:45.750 --> 20:47.030
we beg the High Priest?

20:47.350 --> 20:48.590
He might agree, right?

21:12.720 --> 21:13.440
Mr. Qi!

21:13.440 --> 21:14.590
Isn't he Mr. Qi?

21:14.880 --> 21:15.680
Mr. Qi,

21:15.750 --> 21:16.590
word has it in the city

21:16.590 --> 21:17.510
that you're preparing a new work.

21:17.510 --> 21:18.310
Is it true?

21:18.400 --> 21:19.200
Mr. Qi,

21:19.200 --> 21:19.920
you said you were creating

21:19.920 --> 21:20.880
a new work half a year ago.

21:20.880 --> 21:21.310
We have waited

21:21.310 --> 21:22.440
for so long.

21:22.440 --> 21:23.030
When can we

21:23.030 --> 21:24.280
feast our eyes on your new work?

21:24.310 --> 21:25.070
Yeah!

21:25.070 --> 21:26.680
When can we feast our eyes on it?

21:27.160 --> 21:27.960
Mr. Qi,

21:28.070 --> 21:29.310
could you tell us something

21:29.310 --> 21:30.350
about your new work?

21:30.350 --> 21:32.030
Yes! Please, tell us about it.

21:32.430 --> 21:33.350
Ladies and gentlemen,

21:33.880 --> 21:35.000
when my new work is ready,

21:35.000 --> 21:36.880
I will certainly let you know.

21:37.030 --> 21:38.110
However, for now,

21:38.240 --> 21:40.030
please don't block the road.

21:40.070 --> 21:41.510
After all, I don't own

21:41.510 --> 21:43.000
the streets of Yandu City.

21:44.240 --> 21:45.640
If you keep chasing

21:45.750 --> 21:46.880
after me like this,

21:47.030 --> 21:48.350
I'm afraid it will

21:48.370 --> 21:49.610
bring me a bad reputation.

21:54.720 --> 21:55.510
Mr. Zhao.

21:55.790 --> 21:56.590
Thank you.

21:56.610 --> 21:57.450
You're welcome.

22:00.880 --> 22:01.680
Stop now.

22:03.480 --> 22:04.720
High Priest Yuanzhong,

22:11.200 --> 22:12.920
what a lovely surprise to see you here.

22:13.530 --> 22:15.660
I was looking everywhere for you.

22:16.140 --> 22:16.940
What do you want?

22:19.640 --> 22:21.030
Let's talk inside.

22:26.400 --> 22:27.240
High Priest,

22:27.240 --> 22:28.590
you usually eat here, don't you?

22:30.030 --> 22:31.200
Nobody invited you to come.

22:33.640 --> 22:34.440
Sir,

22:34.680 --> 22:35.720
may I take your order?

22:37.030 --> 22:37.880
Bring me

22:37.880 --> 22:38.760
all the signature dishes

22:38.790 --> 22:40.110
of your restaurant.

22:41.070 --> 22:42.030
I'm sorry.

22:42.030 --> 22:43.310
We only serve noodles,

22:43.310 --> 22:44.310
and nothing else.

22:44.450 --> 22:45.420
Nothing else?

22:49.110 --> 22:50.350
Then go out and buy some.

22:51.240 --> 22:52.070
Go to Dengyun House.

22:52.200 --> 22:53.910
They know what I like to eat.

22:53.980 --> 22:54.780
Plus,

22:55.970 --> 22:57.530
the bill will be paid by this gentleman.

23:03.400 --> 23:04.990
That's it. Just go.

23:05.270 --> 23:06.070
Do as I say.

23:06.480 --> 23:07.280
Okay.

23:33.170 --> 23:34.810
You didn't order the sweet and sour crispy pork for me!

23:43.120 --> 23:44.270
Why are you glaring at me?

23:49.950 --> 23:52.350
You deserve to pay for this meal.

23:52.920 --> 23:54.480
I searched all the hotels,

23:54.480 --> 23:55.790
but I couldn't find you.

23:56.350 --> 23:57.400
Where are you staying?

23:57.640 --> 23:58.790
Cut to the chase.

24:01.000 --> 24:01.880
You know what?

24:03.070 --> 24:04.550
A person's life

24:04.940 --> 24:07.730
is like a long journey.

24:08.440 --> 24:10.470
One may have an idea when his or her journey starts.

24:11.000 --> 24:12.400
But on the way,

24:12.400 --> 24:14.400
he or she might have a change of mind.

24:15.000 --> 24:15.830
Nonetheless,

24:16.790 --> 24:17.830
in any case,

24:18.190 --> 24:20.510
the beautiful scenery remains constant.

24:20.800 --> 24:23.800
You and I are just passersby on her journey.

24:24.350 --> 24:25.220
Do you understand?

24:25.240 --> 24:26.050
No, I don't.

24:27.880 --> 24:29.160
From the bottom of my heart,

24:29.160 --> 24:30.770
I don't think you two are suitable for each other.

24:31.640 --> 24:33.250
There's no way she would be into

24:33.280 --> 24:35.230
someone like you instead of me.

24:39.120 --> 24:40.950
But she still fell for you.

24:41.510 --> 24:42.840
What exactly are you trying to say?

24:43.750 --> 24:44.550
Nothing.

24:44.880 --> 24:45.560
Never mind.

24:46.160 --> 24:47.400
I said that in your best interest.

24:55.160 --> 24:56.670
This is the Divine Left Hand, isn't it?

24:58.200 --> 24:59.400
I've heard it's quite powerful.

24:59.400 --> 25:00.440
Show me what it's capable of.

25:06.200 --> 25:08.960
Are you sure you want to see that?

25:21.400 --> 25:22.200
Forget it.

25:23.200 --> 25:24.030
Don't show me.

25:25.680 --> 25:26.790
High Priest Yuanzhong,

25:28.070 --> 25:30.640
I wish you happiness.

25:32.250 --> 25:33.050
Me?

25:33.270 --> 25:34.070
Yes.

25:35.880 --> 25:37.270
You'll live a long life.

25:45.160 --> 25:46.310
It's a shame I can't enjoy the food now.

25:47.310 --> 25:48.110
Goodbye.

27:04.160 --> 27:05.880
These medicines can improve your energy.

27:06.070 --> 27:07.440
I also bought some snacks

27:07.930 --> 27:09.410
for you and Xue.

27:09.510 --> 27:10.240
Here you are.

27:10.860 --> 27:12.060
Why are you doing all this?

27:14.340 --> 27:16.650
I'd love to help those in need and do a good deed every day.

27:20.340 --> 27:21.180
I know.

27:21.210 --> 27:22.900
Your nature isn't essentially bad.

27:23.310 --> 27:24.030
Otherwise, those

27:24.030 --> 27:25.240
who have tried to catch you along your way

27:25.240 --> 27:26.640
would have died long ago.

27:27.270 --> 27:28.590
I have been deprived of my magic source,

27:28.870 --> 27:29.870
so I couldn't beat them down.

27:30.310 --> 27:31.790
Even though you've lost your magic source,

27:31.920 --> 27:33.000
as a War Demon,

27:33.000 --> 27:34.110
you would barely

27:34.110 --> 27:35.680
break a sweat to kill them.

27:38.590 --> 27:39.880
Some people and some things

27:40.270 --> 27:42.110
are not as simple as they appear.

27:42.590 --> 27:44.110
If you just enjoy being kind and generous,

27:44.350 --> 27:46.110
then please keep your eyes open.

27:46.830 --> 27:47.640
Otherwise,

27:51.680 --> 27:53.480
you might get hurt by someone one day.

27:55.680 --> 27:57.350
I don't understand what you're saying.

27:58.680 --> 28:00.110
The High Priest of the Youhu Clan

28:01.200 --> 28:02.510
has probably turned into a demon.

28:21.030 --> 28:22.590
Look at the sea.

28:23.180 --> 28:24.450
It's dark and gloom.

28:24.830 --> 28:26.220
with raging storms and snow.

28:26.770 --> 28:29.050
Your sea of consciousness is so dark.

28:29.510 --> 28:31.200
It barely has any difference from

28:31.200 --> 28:32.430
the inner world of us demons.

28:32.710 --> 28:34.950
It's your fate to grow into a demon.

28:35.680 --> 28:37.510
Join us now.

28:38.030 --> 28:40.000
Become one with me.

28:40.420 --> 28:42.210
Be a member of the demon clan!

28:42.960 --> 28:43.720
That night,

28:43.720 --> 28:44.640
I overheard the conversation

28:44.640 --> 28:45.830
between them and Li Chaoyang.

28:46.550 --> 28:47.790
Yuanzhong's eyes

28:48.270 --> 28:49.720
are like those of a demon.

28:50.550 --> 28:52.310
Li Chaoyang wouldn't have said those words without reason.

28:52.880 --> 28:54.270
You're with Yuanzhong all the time.

28:54.720 --> 28:56.030
Please do stay alert.

29:05.090 --> 29:11.150
[Liujiao Palace]

29:23.950 --> 29:26.740
♫Too many old dreams♫

29:27.220 --> 29:30.230
♫Where did the snow fall to?♫

29:29.640 --> 29:32.070
Catching a glimpse of Chizhou to the east of Tanlu Pavilion,

29:30.960 --> 29:34.800
♫Going to face a catastrophe♫

29:32.240 --> 29:33.400
I was delighted.

29:33.680 --> 29:35.880
We crossed Di River and Wan Creek.

29:35.190 --> 29:38.020
♫No one is irrelevant♫

29:36.310 --> 29:37.270
After passing through some lonely lands,

29:37.550 --> 29:38.720
we drank sweet wine aplenty.

29:39.400 --> 29:40.510
Everyone enjoyed the party.

29:41.200 --> 29:43.870
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

29:41.350 --> 29:42.720
There was a good spread of delicious and precious food.

29:43.890 --> 29:48.080
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

29:43.920 --> 29:45.070
Countless jugs of wine were provided.

29:45.750 --> 29:48.720
Laying on ice, we drank happily; watching the snow, we sang pleasantly.

29:48.740 --> 29:52.350
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

29:52.370 --> 29:55.400
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

29:54.400 --> 29:55.510
On a clear night,

29:56.440 --> 29:57.920
an unusual phenomenon appeared.

29:56.500 --> 29:58.500
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

29:58.530 --> 30:00.530
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

29:58.590 --> 29:59.720
Across the black sky,

30:00.310 --> 30:02.000
a beam of five-colored light showed up.

30:00.740 --> 30:04.020
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

30:02.740 --> 30:03.870
It was like a dragon, or a snake.

30:04.290 --> 30:07.390
♫If between oaths♫

30:04.550 --> 30:05.790
The whole space was lit up.

30:06.670 --> 30:07.830
It didn't go away until half a month later.

30:07.640 --> 30:09.440
♫I hold onto the longing for just one more glance♫

30:09.710 --> 30:13.110
♫Unwilling to bid farewell for good♫

30:13.950 --> 30:15.950
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

30:14.680 --> 30:15.470
Yuanzhong,

30:15.940 --> 30:18.020
this world is really big.

30:16.320 --> 30:18.290
♫Longing fades in half♫

30:18.440 --> 30:19.750
The feuds between Youhu Clan

30:18.480 --> 30:22.290
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

30:19.750 --> 30:21.680
and the War Demons aren't the only thing that exists.

30:22.510 --> 30:24.160
You should go out, see the world,

30:23.430 --> 30:30.360
♫A thousand years of long nights, yearning from dawn to dusk♫

30:24.610 --> 30:26.290
and spend some joyful days.

30:43.350 --> 30:44.440
You want to read it too?

30:46.880 --> 30:47.750
Then let's read it together.

30:51.250 --> 30:53.920
♫A slight ripple in my gaze♫

30:53.590 --> 30:57.310
Catching a glimpse of Chizhou to the east of Tanlu Pavilion,

30:53.940 --> 30:57.650
♫Who knows the warmth and cold of my fleeting life?♫

30:57.510 --> 30:58.950
I was delighted.

30:58.180 --> 31:02.100
♫If staying together is difficult, it's not worth it♫

31:02.310 --> 31:05.340
♫I'll return what's left of my life♫

31:06.560 --> 31:08.560
♫Falling into the mortal world♫

31:08.690 --> 31:10.690
♫Wandering through the clouds and rivers♫

31:11.180 --> 31:14.570
♫Being by your side is like finding the shore♫

31:15.240 --> 31:17.190
♫The moon falls by the riverbank♫

31:17.370 --> 31:19.370
♫The light finally dims♫

31:19.430 --> 31:23.780
♫How can my heart be at ease?♫

31:21.000 --> 31:21.920
What are you doing?

31:23.860 --> 31:26.000
♫Tears grow cold in a single cup♫

31:26.030 --> 31:28.000
♫Longing fades in half♫

31:28.360 --> 31:32.170
♫Like flowers in a mirror, or the moon in the water♫

31:29.440 --> 31:30.240
Nothing.

31:31.720 --> 31:32.680
I'm just checking on Xiu.

31:33.150 --> 31:42.910
♫The lonely guest can't sleep, destiny can't be undone; speechless♫

31:45.680 --> 31:46.790
The mushrooms look fresh.

31:57.030 --> 31:58.240
Leave the water till later.

31:58.960 --> 31:59.920
Let the soup be cooked for longer,

32:00.750 --> 32:01.960
so the taste can be stronger.

32:14.270 --> 32:15.440
Where have you been today?

32:17.310 --> 32:18.110
I...

32:21.060 --> 32:22.340
I went to Qiju Pavilion.

32:22.720 --> 32:23.750
What for?

32:24.390 --> 32:25.550
To repair five-wheel fans.

32:27.590 --> 32:28.400
Well...

32:29.640 --> 32:30.510
Mr. Xu

32:31.200 --> 32:32.600
asked me to repair them.

32:36.080 --> 32:37.560
I didn't ask who told you to fix them.

32:38.050 --> 32:40.400
You went to Qiju Pavilion

32:40.480 --> 32:41.270
must be because Mr. Xu

32:41.270 --> 32:42.400
asked you for a favor.

32:44.640 --> 32:45.440
That said,

32:46.160 --> 32:46.960
weren't those fans

32:46.960 --> 32:48.270
just fixed a few days ago?

32:49.590 --> 32:50.680
There are many five-wheel fans.

32:51.310 --> 32:52.510
Dozens of them.

32:53.440 --> 32:54.480
The repair isn't done yet.

33:11.400 --> 33:13.440
Do you remember Xue?

33:16.270 --> 33:17.070
Xue?

33:18.680 --> 33:20.160
Xue from the tower ship.

33:21.400 --> 33:22.550
I mean that handmaiden.

33:23.030 --> 33:23.960
The chubby one,

33:24.240 --> 33:25.680
with a lovely smile.

33:26.790 --> 33:28.110
After she got off the tower ship,

33:28.240 --> 33:30.200
she used her commission to rent a small house.

33:30.550 --> 33:31.590
Now she's staying

33:31.590 --> 33:33.000
near the entrance of Daozi Street.

33:33.480 --> 33:34.880
I was wondering

33:34.960 --> 33:36.830
why she wouldn't go home.

33:36.960 --> 33:38.400
Maybe she just feels unpleasant

33:38.400 --> 33:39.680
to live with her brother and sister-in-law.

33:40.160 --> 33:40.960
And I...

33:53.160 --> 33:54.400
I want to ask you something.

33:55.720 --> 33:56.510
What is it?

33:59.020 --> 34:00.150
At the end of your sea of consciousness,

34:00.960 --> 34:02.440
which is the ninth layer of your dream,

34:03.510 --> 34:04.640
what exactly does it contain?

34:31.880 --> 34:32.800
You want to know that?

34:34.400 --> 34:35.440
Yes, I do.

34:43.590 --> 34:44.800
I'll tell you later.

35:32.840 --> 35:33.630
Qian Lin,

35:33.840 --> 35:34.630
I really don't know

35:34.630 --> 35:35.440
where Tanyin lives.

35:35.440 --> 35:35.920
You can keep following me,

35:35.920 --> 35:37.070
but I still don't know where she lives.

35:37.230 --> 35:38.670
I'm really worried about her.

35:38.800 --> 35:40.150
What are you worried about?

35:40.440 --> 35:41.510
She is with the High Priest

35:41.510 --> 35:42.840
of Youhu Clan now.

35:42.880 --> 35:45.030
The High Priest is a god.

35:45.030 --> 35:46.510
Nobody can hurt her.

35:47.360 --> 35:48.280
A god?

35:48.550 --> 35:49.670
Who knows which he really is,

35:49.810 --> 35:51.000
a god or a demon?

36:19.760 --> 36:21.400
The weather is good.

36:21.550 --> 36:23.150
It's time to come out and enjoy the sunshine.

36:23.520 --> 36:24.330
Indeed.

36:25.330 --> 36:26.730
There is a letter from Elder Xinyao,

36:26.860 --> 36:28.610
inquiring about your condition.

36:30.000 --> 36:30.920
Just tell her

36:31.190 --> 36:32.590
I am all fine.

36:34.110 --> 36:35.110
It turns out that the people

36:35.110 --> 36:36.760
in Fangwai Mountain also care about Mr. Tanghua.

36:39.760 --> 36:40.760
Mr. Tanghua.

36:40.960 --> 36:42.110
Greetings, Young City Lord.

36:42.320 --> 36:44.150
You're looking much better now.

36:44.150 --> 36:45.230
I'm relieved.

36:45.480 --> 36:47.070
Today, I specially brought

36:47.110 --> 36:48.440
some seasonal fruits

36:48.440 --> 36:49.710
to you.

36:50.230 --> 36:51.550
These are some local specialties

36:51.550 --> 36:52.880
of Yandu City.

36:52.960 --> 36:54.070
We do have some fruits

36:54.070 --> 36:55.920
that we usually send to Fangwai Mountain as tributes.

36:56.280 --> 36:58.190
But they're not as good as the freshly picked fruits.

36:58.800 --> 36:59.960
Thank you, Young City Lord.

37:00.280 --> 37:02.030
Are you satisfied with the servants?

37:02.480 --> 37:04.070
If you need anything or have a complaint,

37:04.070 --> 37:05.110
please do let me know.

37:05.450 --> 37:06.860
Thank you for being such a nice host.

37:06.960 --> 37:08.190
Everything is fine here.

37:09.480 --> 37:11.400
Mr. Tanghua, you came from afar.

37:11.400 --> 37:13.360
It has been long since you left home.

37:13.590 --> 37:15.190
I believe there are many affairs to

37:15.190 --> 37:16.440
be dealt with in Fangwai Mountain.

37:16.800 --> 37:18.070
It's no wonder that Immortal Elder Xinyao

37:18.070 --> 37:20.230
often sends her regards to you.

37:21.100 --> 37:22.620
Elder Xinyao is kind.

37:22.880 --> 37:24.630
She cares about everyone in the clan,

37:24.710 --> 37:25.540
not just me.

37:26.030 --> 37:27.510
But you're still different.

37:27.630 --> 37:28.880
You are the commander of

37:28.880 --> 37:30.030
the War Division in Youhu Clan.

37:30.030 --> 37:32.000
You hold a high ranking and strong power in the clan.

37:32.110 --> 37:32.840
I bet

37:32.870 --> 37:34.880
they need to ask your advice

37:34.880 --> 37:35.760
about numerous affairs

37:35.760 --> 37:37.190
on a daily basis.

37:38.190 --> 37:39.400
I think I hardly handle as many

37:39.400 --> 37:40.960
issues as you do, Young City Lord.

37:41.590 --> 37:42.800
The old city lord is in seclusion now.

37:42.960 --> 37:44.670
I believe you must be attending to

37:44.760 --> 37:45.880
all the affairs in Yandu City right now,

37:45.880 --> 37:46.880
aren't you, Young City Lord?

37:48.320 --> 37:49.880
Now that I'm in this position,

37:50.030 --> 37:51.190
I have to fulfill my duties.

37:51.400 --> 37:53.510
The War Demons have reappeared.

37:53.840 --> 37:56.800
Next, the War Division of Youhu Clan

37:56.920 --> 37:58.360
will absolutely be busy working

37:58.360 --> 37:59.230
and making plans.

37:59.710 --> 38:01.070
It's true that your health

38:01.070 --> 38:02.070
has improved,

38:02.070 --> 38:03.320
but riding a horse back home

38:03.320 --> 38:04.150
to handle affairs

38:04.150 --> 38:06.150
must be inconvenient to you.

38:06.590 --> 38:07.480
So a few days ago,

38:07.480 --> 38:08.590
I already had my servants

38:08.590 --> 38:10.280
prepare a cozy carriage

38:10.510 --> 38:12.150
for your use.

38:15.440 --> 38:17.760
Young City Lord, it's very considerate of you.

38:18.000 --> 38:18.800
Jiuguang,

38:19.120 --> 38:20.050
wash the fruits

38:20.080 --> 38:21.230
brought by Young City Lord,

38:21.230 --> 38:22.400
and get us a pot of tea.

38:22.800 --> 38:23.920
I've been here for days,

38:24.030 --> 38:25.920
yet you and I haven't had a nice talk.

38:26.710 --> 38:27.510
That's true.

38:27.800 --> 38:28.590
Young City Lord.

38:28.920 --> 38:29.880
Mr. Tanghua,

38:29.880 --> 38:31.440
it's time you took medicine.

38:31.480 --> 38:32.470
As Young Mistress Zhi Dai said,

38:32.470 --> 38:33.710
you can't drink tea before taking medicine.

38:33.710 --> 38:34.920
Would you come back inside?

38:36.420 --> 38:37.500
I nearly forgot it.

38:38.670 --> 38:41.540
Young City Lord, I'm sorry I have to go.

38:43.460 --> 38:44.270
No problem.

38:55.950 --> 38:57.240
Youhu Clan

38:57.880 --> 38:59.480
just won't leave us alone.

39:01.440 --> 39:03.080
He can't keep spying on us for much longer.

39:03.950 --> 39:06.030
The commander of Youhu Clan's War Division

39:06.370 --> 39:08.480
can't stay forever in Yandu City, right?

39:11.280 --> 39:12.590
The young city lord

39:13.630 --> 39:14.790
seems to be up to something.

39:16.420 --> 39:17.270
Keep an eye on him.

39:18.960 --> 39:19.710
I need to know

39:19.710 --> 39:21.550
what Zhi Yue is planning.

39:39.400 --> 39:40.920
I heard that the people in Yandu City

39:40.940 --> 39:42.530
had prepared a long time for this lantern show.

39:43.230 --> 39:44.030
Everyone has brought out

39:44.030 --> 39:45.760
all the pretty lanterns they have.

39:46.880 --> 39:48.000
So beautiful.

39:48.150 --> 39:49.590
Humans are always gifted

39:49.930 --> 39:51.300
at things like this.

39:54.230 --> 39:55.800
It didn't sound like a compliment.

39:56.330 --> 39:57.690
But it was, genuinely.

39:58.510 --> 39:59.670
I do appreciate a lot of things

40:00.280 --> 40:01.510
created by humans.

40:03.960 --> 40:04.760
Sir,

40:04.760 --> 40:05.800
here's a lantern for you.

40:05.800 --> 40:07.030
May good fortune befall you.

40:07.030 --> 40:07.760
Thank you.

40:12.360 --> 40:13.670
Such an auspicious omen.

40:15.070 --> 40:16.150
Just like the Lucky Eggs you created.

40:17.510 --> 40:18.320
Here you are.

40:32.110 --> 40:33.550
You have a beautiful smile now.

40:34.230 --> 40:35.190
Several days ago,

40:35.840 --> 40:37.430
you looked preoccupied.

40:51.320 --> 40:52.630
There are much more

40:53.000 --> 40:54.510
patrol guards today than before.

40:55.960 --> 40:56.920
That's for sure.

40:57.360 --> 40:58.590
This is a big event.

40:58.680 --> 41:00.400
They are deployed to ward off villains.

41:03.550 --> 41:04.760
When you traveled around

41:04.760 --> 41:06.000
as the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain,

41:06.540 --> 41:08.230
did you encounter anyone evil?

41:08.520 --> 41:10.120
How do you define "evil"?

41:11.290 --> 41:12.370
Those who are born evil, do or say evil things

41:12.400 --> 41:13.400
or harbor evil thoughts

41:13.700 --> 41:14.740
are evil.

41:15.960 --> 41:17.480
Of course I did.

41:17.760 --> 41:18.550
What happened then?

41:18.960 --> 41:20.110
What did you do?

41:22.670 --> 41:24.240
I would try to reason with them.

41:24.550 --> 41:25.920
What if you couldn't get through to them?

41:26.030 --> 41:26.880
In that case,

41:27.110 --> 41:27.800
I would use

41:27.830 --> 41:29.300
the Mute Lady of Wu Mountain's own way.

41:30.960 --> 41:31.920
The Mute Lady of Wu Mountain

41:31.920 --> 41:34.070
is regarded as a god by the people of the Eastern Wilderness.

41:34.280 --> 41:35.400
She would help anyone.

41:35.970 --> 41:38.130
It's hard to imagine she would have a way to deal with evil people.

41:40.510 --> 41:42.840
A Bodhisattva lowered eyebrows and a Vajra's angry glare

41:43.110 --> 41:44.230
both represent mercy.

41:44.840 --> 41:45.920
If one knows something is evil

41:46.000 --> 41:47.320
but still indulges it,

41:47.550 --> 41:48.760
then this person is doing evil.

41:52.360 --> 41:53.150
Right.

41:54.320 --> 41:55.110
However,

41:56.190 --> 41:58.000
what if an evil person is wronged?

42:00.910 --> 42:02.100
Only what one does can define who he is.

42:03.190 --> 42:04.670
Nobody is perfect if judged by their thoughts.

42:05.000 --> 42:06.920
For those who harbor evil intentions or speak evil things,

42:07.280 --> 42:08.670
we cannot ignore

42:08.670 --> 42:09.880
how they have been wronged.

42:10.480 --> 42:11.920
For those who are born evil or do evil deeds,

42:12.000 --> 42:12.960
we should look at

42:13.000 --> 42:14.480
the results of their doings.

42:16.410 --> 42:19.210
It sounds like there are certain standards.

42:20.320 --> 42:21.110
But

42:22.160 --> 42:23.480
who set up those standards?

42:24.360 --> 42:26.220
Can you represent fairness and justice?

42:27.590 --> 42:28.440
No, I cannot.

42:28.910 --> 42:31.060
But the Six Realms work by their own rules.

42:31.120 --> 42:33.080
Humans have their own laws.

42:33.110 --> 42:35.150
Immortals have their own rules.

42:35.510 --> 42:37.590
If someone goes against the order and rules,

42:37.640 --> 42:38.730
disregards all the living beings，

42:38.890 --> 42:41.440
aims to become a demon and disturbs the harmony,

42:43.070 --> 42:44.800
this person will be punished by heavenly laws.

42:45.300 --> 42:47.220
As many reasons as this person may have,

42:48.190 --> 42:49.510
he or she must pay a price

42:49.510 --> 42:50.590
for what he or she has done.
